c/yin/vm.cljc:404-411`; `test/yin/vm/bytes_to_str_test.cljc:34-43`; owner decision 2026-10-23 | host-boundary/OQ11 | resolved: encoding arity 2 removed from portable profile, leaving unary strict UTF-8 decoding arity `[1]` on every lane; `src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc` removed from H0 gate list-1 | closed |\n508\t| yang.php: a fractional exponent with a non-integral float power (`2 ** 0.5`) refuses with `Error \"** with a fractional exponent ...\"`; the host has no `pow` export yet (`G-pow-frac`) | R1 adjudication item 1b; executable refusal fixture `yang.php.antlr.e2e-test/pow-fractional-refusal-test` | yang.php | the P1 follow-up that exports a host `pow` | P2 |\n509\t| yang.typescript: `**` with a non-integral finite exponent (`4 ** 0.5`) throws a guest `TypeError` naming `G-pow-frac`; `**` ports `py/fpow`'s integer squaring rule (T1 plan §5) and the host has no portable `pow` export (same gap as yang.php `G-pow-frac` and yang.python `float-power`) | T1 gate R2 (astra) R2-06; Architect adjudication 1792960000000; refusal fixture `yang.typescript.antlr.e2e-test` pow-fractional | yang.typescript with the host-boundary seat | the follow-up that exports a host `pow` (closes PHP, Python and TS together) | P2 |\n510\t| yang.typescript: `Number.prototype.toString(radix)` with a non-integral receiver and radix ≠ 10 (`(0.5).toString(2)`) throws a guest `TypeError` naming `G-radix-frac`; the T1 surface is Number::toString(10) plus integer radix output (T1 plan §6); fractional radix output needs V8's digit loop ported and proven host-stable | T1 gate R2 R2-07; adjudication 1792960000000; refusal fixture `e2e-test` radix-fractional | yang.typescript | the slice completing `%Number.prototype%` (T2 by §9, or a numbers follow-up) | P3 |\n511\t| Closed (Stage 0 S3, branch yang-ts-t2b): yang.typescript ordinary functions carried no `prototype` own property; `:normal` function cells now get an eager `prototype` (writable, non-enumerable, non-configurable) with the `constructor` back-link |